与台词进程】**：<br>1. 女生身体微微扭动，不安地看着镜头。此时，镜头外传来一个男声大喊：**“看着我看着我看着我看着我，站好。”**<br>2. 女生听到指令后，双手抓着钞票向身体左侧（镜头左侧）挪了挪，脸上绽放出甜美而有些勉强的笑容，眼睛紧盯着镜头。<br>3. 接着，男声继续喊道：**“看着我，站好站好站好，对对对。”**<br>4. 女生顺从地配合，身体贴紧木板，保持着笑容，双手紧紧攥着钞票放在大腿前侧。<br>5. 就在这时，一把飞斧突然从镜头外飞出，伴随着“咚”的一声巨响，精准地劈在女生身体右侧（镜头右侧）的木板上，距离她的肩膀仅有十几公分。女生被突如其来的飞斧吓得身体猛地一缩，笑容瞬间消失，眼神中充满了惊恐，但依然紧贴着木板不敢乱动。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 85, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 270], "pos": [1110, 0], "id": 38, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [85], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["google/gemini-3.5-flash", "You are a helpful assistant", "Hello", 0.6, 657615107, "randomize", 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 87, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized